step Telf Joolam - the torch (Shaman)

  zone map 1411

  when onquest 1525

  note Call of Fire (1525) needs 1524 turned in, which lives outside this contract (the Barrens guide turns it in) - this mini-step only shows on the quest. The Fire Tar has no Durotar source in the data: Razormane in the Barrens and Tunnel Rats in Loch Modan drop it, so bring one. The Reagent Pouch comes off Burning Blade cultists around Skull Rock (51.89,25.71 - the Margoz leg below). Telf Joolam waits west (38.55,58.96).

  accept 1525 only Shaman -- Call of Fire - Telf Joolam; fire tar from outside, a reagent pouch at Skull Rock

